Get the full layout of a Zero Block (tplid 396) as JSON: artboard settings (ab_* keys) and every element (text, image, shape, button, form…) with its position and style for every breakpoint. A Zero Block just added with add_record contains demo content of the editor (sample texts, an image, a shape) — replace it. Use it before update_zero_block: read the current JSON, change it, write it back whole. The format is described by the zero_block_instructions tool — call it before changing a Zero Block.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
