Upload one or more images or WOFF/WOFF2 web fonts and get back CDN URLs. Images… Call describe_tool with tool_name="upload_image" for the full description before using.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__tilda__upload_image(args: {
  // List of images or WOFF/WOFF2 font files to upload (max 8 per request).
  images: Array<{
  // Optional original filename of the image or font. Only used with "image_base64". Ignored for "image_url".
  filename?: string;
  // Base64-encoded contents of the image or WOFF/WOFF2 file. A "data:<mimetype>;base64,<data>" URI is also accepted. Exactly one of "image_base64" or "image_url" must be provided.
  image_base64?: string;
  // A publicly accessible http(s) URL of the image to fetch and upload. Exactly one of "image_base64" or "image_url" must be provided.
  image_url?: string;
  // MIME type of the image (for example image/png or image/jpeg) or font (font/woff or font/woff2). Only used with "image_base64", and required unless it can be derived from a data URI. Ignored for "image_url".
  mimetype?: string;
}>;
  // ID of the project the uploaded files belong to, from get_projects.
  projectid: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

